<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>By touching "Maintenance" on the screen while the information mode screen is displayed, the screen changes to the maintenance menu screen, where various maintenance information such as oil change timing can be displayed and entered (timing, distance, dealer, etc.). Also, by touching "Personal Items" on the screen while the maintenance menu screen is displayed, the screen changes to the personal items screen, where personal information such as the license renewal date can be displayed and dates can be entered.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
